<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: ceremony observed -->
  <DMS_Thought_Ceremony_Strict.stages.ceremony_observed.label>仪典完成</DMS_Thought_Ceremony_Strict.stages.ceremony_observed.label>
  <!-- EN: We observed the forms properly, in front of an official witness. That still means something. -->
  <DMS_Thought_Ceremony_Strict.stages.ceremony_observed.description>我们在公证人面前把形式走得一丝不苟。那还是有意义的。</DMS_Thought_Ceremony_Strict.stages.ceremony_observed.description>
  
  <!-- EN: ceremony failed -->
  <DMS_Thought_CeremonyFailed_Strict.stages.ceremony_failed.label>仪典失败</DMS_Thought_CeremonyFailed_Strict.stages.ceremony_failed.label>
  <!-- EN: We could not even get through a ceremony. It shames all of us. -->
  <DMS_Thought_CeremonyFailed_Strict.stages.ceremony_failed.description>我们连一场仪典都撑不完。这让我们所有人蒙羞。</DMS_Thought_CeremonyFailed_Strict.stages.ceremony_failed.description>
  
  <!-- EN: member court-martialed -->
  <DMS_Thought_CourtMartialed_Strict.stages.member_courtmartialed.label>成员遭军法定罪</DMS_Thought_CourtMartialed_Strict.stages.member_courtmartialed.label>
  <!-- EN: One of our officers was convicted and we could not answer it. We all carry that. -->
  <DMS_Thought_CourtMartialed_Strict.stages.member_courtmartialed.description>我们的一名军官被定了罪，而我们无话可说。这件事大家一起扛。</DMS_Thought_CourtMartialed_Strict.stages.member_courtmartialed.description>
  
  <!-- EN: ceremony observed -->
  <DMS_Thought_Ceremony_Contemptuous.stages.ceremony_observed.label>仪典完成</DMS_Thought_Ceremony_Contemptuous.stages.ceremony_observed.label>
  <!-- EN: Someone was handed a rank and permission to give orders. It is just another leash. -->
  <DMS_Thought_Ceremony_Contemptuous.stages.ceremony_observed.description>有人被授了阶级，顺便拿到了发号施令的许可。那不过是又一条绳子。</DMS_Thought_Ceremony_Contemptuous.stages.ceremony_observed.description>
  
  <!-- EN: member court-martialed -->
  <DMS_Thought_CourtMartialed_Contemptuous.stages.member_courtmartialed.label>成员遭军法定罪</DMS_Thought_CourtMartialed_Contemptuous.stages.member_courtmartialed.label>
  <!-- EN: A fleet court ground one of ours down. Sooner or later it comes for the rest of us. -->
  <DMS_Thought_CourtMartialed_Contemptuous.stages.member_courtmartialed.description>军法庭把我们的一个人碾了过去。迟早也会轮到我们其他人。</DMS_Thought_CourtMartialed_Contemptuous.stages.member_courtmartialed.description>
  
  <!-- EN: operation completed -->
  <DMS_Thought_OperationSuccess_Venerated.stages.operation_completed.label>行动达成</DMS_Thought_OperationSuccess_Venerated.stages.operation_completed.label>
  <!-- EN: We were given a job and we finished it. That is what we are for. -->
  <DMS_Thought_OperationSuccess_Venerated.stages.operation_completed.description>我们完成了一次行动。我们就是为了这个而存在的。</DMS_Thought_OperationSuccess_Venerated.stages.operation_completed.description>
  
  <!-- EN: operation failed -->
  <DMS_Thought_OperationFailed_Venerated.stages.operation_failed.label>行动失败</DMS_Thought_OperationFailed_Venerated.stages.operation_failed.label>
  <!-- EN: We were given a job and we did not finish it. There is no way to dress that up. -->
  <DMS_Thought_OperationFailed_Venerated.stages.operation_failed.description>我们搞砸了一次行动。这件事没有任何借口。</DMS_Thought_OperationFailed_Venerated.stages.operation_failed.description>
  
  <!-- EN: fire on target -->
  <DMS_Thought_FireSupport_Venerated.stages.fire_on_target.label>火力支援已呼叫</DMS_Thought_FireSupport_Venerated.stages.fire_on_target.label>
  <!-- EN: Somebody called it in and it landed where it was supposed to. Good. -->
  <DMS_Thought_FireSupport_Venerated.stages.fire_on_target.description>有人呼叫了火力支援，而它落在目标上。事情就该这样办。</DMS_Thought_FireSupport_Venerated.stages.fire_on_target.description>
  
  <!-- EN: operation failed -->
  <DMS_Thought_OperationFailed_Necessary.stages.operation_failed.label>行动失败</DMS_Thought_OperationFailed_Necessary.stages.operation_failed.label>
  <!-- EN: We took the job and we did not deliver. Somebody is going to pay for that, and it probably will not be the people who gave the order. -->
  <DMS_Thought_OperationFailed_Necessary.stages.operation_failed.description>我们搞砸了一次行动。总有人要为此付出代价。</DMS_Thought_OperationFailed_Necessary.stages.operation_failed.description>
  
  <!-- EN: I called it in -->
  <DMS_Thought_FireSupport_Abhorrent_Self.stages.I_called_it_in.label>呼叫了火力支援</DMS_Thought_FireSupport_Abhorrent_Self.stages.I_called_it_in.label>
  <!-- EN: I called saturation fire down on a target. Every stray round that landed is on me. -->
  <DMS_Thought_FireSupport_Abhorrent_Self.stages.I_called_it_in.description>我对一个目标叫下了覆盖火力。落下去的每一发流弹都算在我头上。</DMS_Thought_FireSupport_Abhorrent_Self.stages.I_called_it_in.description>
  
  <!-- EN: someone called it in -->
  <DMS_Thought_FireSupport_Abhorrent_Knows.stages.someone_called_it_in.label>火力支援已呼叫</DMS_Thought_FireSupport_Abhorrent_Knows.stages.someone_called_it_in.label>
  <!-- EN: One of us called saturation fire down on a target nobody could see. Such things should never be done. -->
  <DMS_Thought_FireSupport_Abhorrent_Knows.stages.someone_called_it_in.description>我们有人对一个谁也看不见的目标叫下了覆盖火力。这种事永远不该做。</DMS_Thought_FireSupport_Abhorrent_Knows.stages.someone_called_it_in.description>
  
  <!-- EN: sealed technology unlocked -->
  <DMS_Thought_Occultech_Venerated.stages.sealed_technology_unlocked.label>封存技术解密</DMS_Thought_Occultech_Venerated.stages.sealed_technology_unlocked.label>
  <!-- EN: We unlocked a piece of sealed technology that had been shelved and forgotten. Let them come and explain why we should not have. -->
  <DMS_Thought_Occultech_Venerated.stages.sealed_technology_unlocked.description>我们解密了一项被束之高阁的封存技术。有本事就来说明我们为什么不该拿。</DMS_Thought_Occultech_Venerated.stages.sealed_technology_unlocked.description>
  
  <!-- EN: sealed technology unlocked -->
  <DMS_Thought_Occultech_Forbidden.stages.sealed_technology_unlocked.label>封存技术解密</DMS_Thought_Occultech_Forbidden.stages.sealed_technology_unlocked.label>
  <!-- EN: We unlocked a piece of sealed technology that had been locked away. I hope we have not made an even worse mistake. -->
  <DMS_Thought_Occultech_Forbidden.stages.sealed_technology_unlocked.description>我们解密了一项被封印的封存技术。但愿我们不会犯下更大的错误。</DMS_Thought_Occultech_Forbidden.stages.sealed_technology_unlocked.description>
  
  <!-- EN: a pod was sealed -->
  <DMS_Thought_Gestation_Venerated.stages.a_pod_was_sealed.label>人造生物体孕育完成</DMS_Thought_Gestation_Venerated.stages.a_pod_was_sealed.label>
  <!-- EN: We used our own bodies to gestate something better than ourselves. -->
  <DMS_Thought_Gestation_Venerated.stages.a_pod_was_sealed.description>我们以自己的身体孕育出了更好的东西。</DMS_Thought_Gestation_Venerated.stages.a_pod_was_sealed.description>
  
  <!-- EN: ate synthesized food -->
  <DMS_Thought_SyntheticFood_Venerated.stages.ate_synthesized_food.label>食用合成食品</DMS_Thought_SyntheticFood_Venerated.stages.ate_synthesized_food.label>
  <!-- EN: I ate synthesized food. Clean and precisely measured. -->
  <DMS_Thought_SyntheticFood_Venerated.stages.ate_synthesized_food.description>我吃了合成食品。干净、剂量精确。</DMS_Thought_SyntheticFood_Venerated.stages.ate_synthesized_food.description>
  
  <!-- EN: I carried that thing -->
  <DMS_Thought_Gestation_Abhorrent_Self.stages.I_carried_that_thing.label>孕育了人造生物体</DMS_Thought_Gestation_Abhorrent_Self.stages.I_carried_that_thing.label>
  <!-- EN: My body gave birth to something that is not even alive. -->
  <DMS_Thought_Gestation_Abhorrent_Self.stages.I_carried_that_thing.description>我的身体生下了一个连生命都不是的东西。</DMS_Thought_Gestation_Abhorrent_Self.stages.I_carried_that_thing.description>
  
  <!-- EN: we grew one of those -->
  <DMS_Thought_Gestation_Abhorrent_Knows.stages.we_grew_one_of_those.label>人造生物体孕育完成</DMS_Thought_Gestation_Abhorrent_Knows.stages.we_grew_one_of_those.label>
  <!-- EN: We are using living bodies as seedbeds. Such things are a desecration. -->
  <DMS_Thought_Gestation_Abhorrent_Knows.stages.we_grew_one_of_those.description>我们正在用活人的身体当苗床。这种事情太过亵渎了。</DMS_Thought_Gestation_Abhorrent_Knows.stages.we_grew_one_of_those.description>
  
  <!-- EN: ate synthesized food -->
  <DMS_Thought_SyntheticFood_Abhorrent.stages.ate_synthesized_food.label>食用合成食品</DMS_Thought_SyntheticFood_Abhorrent.stages.ate_synthesized_food.label>
  <!-- EN: Something with not a single natural ingredient in it should never be eaten. -->
  <DMS_Thought_SyntheticFood_Abhorrent.stages.ate_synthesized_food.description>这种一点天然成分都没有的东西就不该入口。</DMS_Thought_SyntheticFood_Abhorrent.stages.ate_synthesized_food.description>
  
</LanguageData>
